  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed conversion of the property into an seven-bedroom Large House in Multiple Occupation (HMO) would be unacceptable in principle due to the site’s poor accessibility to public transport and essential services, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024) and policy HO10 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041), the Housing Design Standards London Plan Guidance (2023) and the Residential Design Guide Supplementary Planning Document (2010).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of the insufficient shared internal communal spaces provided, would result in a poor standard of accommodation, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), policies D3 and D6 The London Plan (2021), GR1C and HO10(5), (6) and (7) of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041), the Residential Design Guide SPD (2010) and the Housing Design Standards London Plan Guidance (2023).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
